    "body": "### Describe the bug\n\nI know abi3t is a work in progress, per https://github.com/cython/cython/issues/7399, but noticed this issue when getting read to test `freethreading-limited-api-preview`\n\n### Code to reproduce the behaviour:\n\nA minimal `cdef class` fails to compile under `Py_TARGET_ABI3T` on\n`freethreading-limited-api-preview` when CYTHON_USE_MODULE_STATE is set.\n\n### Environment\n\n- CPython 3.15.0rc1 free-threaded (tested on Windows & WSL Ubuntu)\n- Cython `3.3.0a0` source built from `freethreading-limited-api-preview` (`926f518`)\n- setuptools 83.0.0\n\n### Reproducer\n\n`reproabi3t.pyx`:\n\n```cython\n# cython: language_level=3\n# cython: freethreading_compatible=True\n\ncdef class Thing:\n    cdef int value\n\n    def __init__(self, int v):\n        self.value = v\n\n    def get(self):\n        return self.value\n```\n\n`setup.py`:\n\n```python\nfrom setuptools import Extension, setup\nfrom Cython.Build import cythonize\n\next = Extension(\n    \"reproabi3t\",\n    [\"reproabi3t.pyx\"],\n    define_macros=[\n        (\"CYTHON_USE_MODULE_STATE\", \"1\"),\n        (\"Py_LIMITED_API\", \"0x030f0000\"),\n        (\"Py_TARGET_ABI3T\", \"0x030f0000\"),\n        (\"CYTHON_OPAQUE_OBJECTS\", \"1\"),\n    ],\n    py_limited_api=True,\n    language=\"c++\",\n)\n\nsetup(name=\"reproabi3t\", ext_modules=cythonize([ext]))\n```\n\nRun:\n\n```bash\nuv run --python cpython-3.15.0rc1+freethreaded \\\n  --with \"cython @ git+https://github.com/cython/cython@freethreading-limited-api-preview\" \\\n  --with setuptools \\\n  python setup.py build_ext --inplace\n```\n\n### Result\n\n```\n[1/1] Cythonizing reproabi3t.pyx\nrunning build_ext\nbuilding 'reproabi3t' extension\ncl.exe /c ... -DCYTHON_USE_MODULE_STATE=1 -DPy_LIMITED_API=0x030f0000 \\\n  -DPy_TARGET_ABI3T=0x030f0000 -DCYTHON_OPAQUE_OBJECTS=1 -DPy_GIL_DISABLED=1 ...\nreproabi3t.cpp\nreproabi3t.cpp(4467): error C2664: 'int PyState_RemoveModule(PyModuleDef *)':\n  cannot convert argument 1 from 'char *' to 'PyModuleDef *'\n```\n\n\n\n### Expected behaviour\n\n_No response_\n\n### OS\n\nWSL Ubuntu & Windows\n\n### Python version\n\n3.15.0rc0 - free threaded\n\n### Cython version\n\nsource build from freethreading-limited-api-preview\n\n### Additional context\n\n_No response_",
